<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450410" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 4 — Table with merged cells</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d749e7">
         <p>Consider a table where cells are merged vertically across rows using the <codeph>rowspan</codeph> attribute — for example, to associate one server group value with several related rows.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table with merged cells</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_qtr_vzn_lkc">
&lt;table>
  &lt;caption>Server Role Mapping&lt;/caption>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;th>Server Group&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Server Name&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Status&lt;/th>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td rowspan="2">Production&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>server-01&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Active&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>server-02&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Active&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>Backup&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>server-03&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Standby&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_efc_wzn_lkc">
&lt;reference id="server_role_mapping">
  &lt;title>Server Role Mapping&lt;/title>
  &lt;refbody>
    &lt;table>
      &lt;title>Server Role Mapping&lt;/title>
      &lt;tgroup cols="3">
        &lt;colspec colname="c1"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c2"/>
        &lt;colspec colname="c3"/>
        &lt;thead>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Server Group&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Server Name&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Status&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/thead>
        &lt;tbody>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry morerows="1">Production&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>server-01&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Active&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>server-02&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Active&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
          &lt;row>
            &lt;entry>Backup&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>server-03&lt;/entry>
            &lt;entry>Standby&lt;/entry>
          &lt;/row>
        &lt;/tbody>
      &lt;/tgroup>
    &lt;/table>
  &lt;/refbody>
&lt;/reference></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p><b>Result:</b>The rowspan=\"2\" maps to morerows=\"1\" on the DITA <codeph>&lt;entry&gt;</codeph> element. Merged cells always produce CALS <codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph> + <codeph>&lt;tgroup&gt;</codeph> output.</p>
         <note type="warning"> Merged-cell structures with spanning headers, grouped values, or irregular layouts require manual review after conversion. Verify that the generated DITA table accurately reflects the source structure.</note>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
